# Netlify (also used by drag-and-drop deploys, which ignore netlify.toml).
# Existing files (assets, /families data, /vendor) are always served first. Missing data or vendor files are real 404s,
# never the app page; every other path (/RF00167, /) is the single-page app, which picks the family from the path.
/families/*   /404.html     404
/vendor/*     /404.html     404
/assets/*     /404.html     404
/thumbnails/* /404.html     404
/*            /index.html   200
